<title>USA: IPO PRICING - First Virtual priced at $9/shr.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - First Virtual priced at $9/shr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name     First Virtual Holdings Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					  $9</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $11 - $13</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			2,000,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	    Bear Stearns &amp; Co</p>
<p>NOTE: The proposed number of shares in the offering was decreased to two million from three million, the underwriter said.</p>
<p>The San Diego-based company develops and implements the Virtual PIN for the Internet.</p>
</text>
